Revision history for Coin::Hnoss

0.005  2026-11-09
       - Add comparison and predicates to Coin::Hnoss::Money:
         compare, is_zero, is_positive, is_negative, greater_than,
         greater_or_equal, less_than, less_or_equal.
       - Overload <=>, ==, !=, <, >, <=, >= to use compare (croak on
         currency mismatch instead of comparing object addresses).

0.004_01 2026-11-09
       - Document that divide / divide_with_remainder use floor semantics
         (matching Math::BigInt::bdiv and Python's divmod), not truncation
         toward zero. Fix arithmetic tests to match.

0.004  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Exception base class.
       - Add arithmetic to Coin::Hnoss::Money: add, subtract, multiply,
         divide, divide_with_remainder, negate, abs.

0.003  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money (immutable amount + currency value object).

0.002  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency (ISO 4217 code value object).

0.001  2026-11-09
       - Initial skeleton.
